# ── 000-docs ignore policy — owned HERE, not in the root .gitignore ──────────
# Model: LOCAL BY DEFAULT. Filing a document public = append one negation line
# to the PUBLIC FILING LEDGER below, then `git add` it (no -f needed).
# A plain `git add` on an unledgered doc ERRORS loudly — that is the design
# working. Never bulk-add this directory with -A or globs.
# DO NOT SORT THIS FILE — the blanket must stay first; ledger lines append.
# Why this file exists: the root allowlist was order-dead (negations sorted
# above the blanket; last-match-wins killed every re-include) and silently kept
# ~200 filed docs local — Mission 01, docs 720/726, bead claude-5awj.6.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!000-INDEX.md
!000-*.md
!agentskills-spec-snapshot.md
!anthropic-skills-spec-snapshot.md

